WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.460
Bot's hose shook.

2
00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:05.841
Ringo's phone was in it.

3
00:00:05.842 --> 00:00:09.362
"My hose is jammed," Bot said.

4
00:00:09.363 --> 00:00:13.952
"I need my phone!" Ringo said.

5
00:00:13.953 --> 00:00:16.551
"Don't worry," Bot said.

6
00:00:16.552 --> 00:00:19.231
"I'll blow it back out."

7
00:00:19.232 --> 00:00:21.929
The hose stopped shaking.

8
00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.651
Boom! Ringo's phone shot out.

9
00:00:25.652 --> 00:00:28.380
Other things shot out.

10
00:00:28.381 --> 00:00:33.180
"Whoa!" Ringo ducked.

11
00:00:33.181 --> 00:00:35.542
Then . . . Poomf!

12
00:00:35.543 --> 00:00:39.462
Dirt and dust shot out.

13
00:00:39.463 --> 00:00:42.610
A dust cloud filled the room.

14
00:00:42.611 --> 00:00:48.200
"Ah-choo!" Ringo groaned.

15
00:00:48.201 --> 00:00:51.453
"Now my room is even messier!"

16
00:00:51.454 --> 00:01:00.286
Bot sighed. "Sorry, Ringo."

17
00:01:00.287 --> 00:01:05.097
Ringo's phone beeped.

18
00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:08.037
It was a message from Captain Nova.

19
00:01:08.038 --> 00:01:12.302
"Come to my office, Ringo!"

20
00:01:12.303 --> 00:01:17.507
"Come on, Bot," Ringo said.

21
00:01:17.508 --> 00:01:20.559
"We'll clean later!"

22
00:01:27.897 --> 00:01:33.136
They went to Captain Nova's office.

23
00:01:33.137 --> 00:01:36.795
Lucy and PJ were there too.

24
00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:40.511
"Ringo, Lucy," Captain Nova said.

25
00:01:40.512 --> 00:01:42.653
"A satellite is broken.

26
00:01:42.654 --> 00:01:46.331
You two must fix it."

27
00:01:46.332 --> 00:01:48.221
Ringo beamed.

28
00:01:48.222 --> 00:01:50.178
"We can do it, Captain!"

29
00:01:50.179 --> 00:01:51.863
He looked at Lucy.

30
00:01:51.864 --> 00:01:54.887
"Ready, buddy?" he asked.

31
00:01:54.888 --> 00:01:57.327
Lucy frowned.

32
00:01:57.328 --> 00:02:01.133
"I have PJ, Captain," she said.

33
00:02:01.134 --> 00:02:05.099
"I don't need Tiny's help!"

34
00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.634
"It's an important mission," Captain Nova said.

35
00:02:08.635 --> 00:02:11.237
"Both of you will go.

36
00:02:11.238 --> 00:02:16.318
And you'll fly together!"

